# WUC Portal — Cloud AI API key
#
# Pollinations' old keyless text API is deprecated and returns HTTP 402.
# Use a free keyed provider instead (no credit card for Groq free tier):
#
# 1. Get a FREE API key:
#      - Groq        https://console.groq.com/keys        (recommended)
#      - OpenRouter  https://openrouter.ai/keys
#      - Together    https://api.together.xyz/settings/api-keys
#
# 2. Copy this file to:   ai/cloud_key.txt
#      (the portal reads ai/cloud_key.txt, NOT this .example file)
#
# 3. Replace the line below with your real key (first non-comment line is used):

gsk_PASTE_YOUR_GROQ_KEY_HERE

# Optional overrides (or set as environment variables):
#   WUC_AI_CLOUD_PROVIDER=openrouter-qwen
#   WUC_AI_CLOUD_CHAIN=groq,openrouter-qwen
